            "text": "theorem prefixStream_flux {h : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h) (hh1 : h < 1 / 2)\n    {d : Coefficients} (hd : SmoothCoefficients d) (J : ℕ) (C : ℝ)\n    {p : Chart} (hp : p.1 < 1) :\n    -p.2.1 * AxisymmetricFields.partialZ (BaseResidual.prefixStream J h C d) p =\n      SlowExpansionResidual.slowFlux J h (profiles h d) p"
